From: Signbot AutoDL <zhengsw200304@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 08:33:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Fix gen_keybody action size; vectorize per-step dof
 loops; drop per-step prints; per-clip pose layout

- gen_keybody.py stepped the env with env.num_actions (55) zeros, but the policy
  and the action history buffer use cfg.env.control_actions (11: legs + torso).
- post_physics_step wrote arm/wrist/finger reference angles with a python loop
  over all envs on every step; _reset_dofs looped too. Vectorized.
- reward functions printed GPU tensors every step (sync + log spam); now only
  with SIGNBOT_DEBUG_PRINT=1.
- prepare_smplx_poses.py: auto-detect one-pkl-per-frame vs one-pkl-per-clip
  layouts; --inspect prints layout/keys/shapes without processing.
